==Trivia==
* The [[Hyrule Compendium]] describes Grassland Foxes as solitary animals that do not form packs, which contrasts the behavior of other [[Fox]]es.<ref name="Compendium"/> However, real-life Foxes are all solitary animals. The [[Snowcoat Fox]], the only other type of Fox in-game, also cannot be found in packs.

